c source/matching/game/s20/s20_small_j.c
w3d_s20_release_held_800e41d8|0x800e41d8|Appears to release the held object through virtual method 4, clear the pointer and forward the subobject at offset 28 to a helper.
w3d_s20_forward_global4_800e5d4c|0x800e5d4c|Appears to forward four arguments and a global object to a helper when the global exists, otherwise return zero.
w3d_s20_forward_global4_800fdd80|0x800fdd80|Appears to forward four arguments and a global object to a helper when the global exists, otherwise return 0x80004005.
w3d_s20_check_limit_800e6ec8|0x800e6ec8|Appears to run a helper on three sub-areas and return whether a global limit is at most the value at offset 92.
w3d_s20_clear_top_flags_800fdecc|0x800fdecc|Appears to clear the top two bits of the flag word at offset 92 and run a helper twice with indexes 0 and 1.
